From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: brennoflavio <contato@brennoflavio.com.br>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:33:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] webapi: expose Web Bluetooth with no selectable devices

Model the MacBook Neo Bluetooth 6 adapter using the Chromium 155 macOS surface. Honor secure contexts, policy, and transient activation. Dismiss valid requests without host scanning, device grants, or GATT.
---
